        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During 2025, we continued to develop our route and schedule optimization processes to better utilize our logistics resources across all product lines, improve the customer experience, and differentiate from the competition.",
        "start_character": 31881,
        "end_character": 32104
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During 2025, we expanded account management teams and vertically-aligned business development resources to build our enterprise account customer portfolio and more importantly, create focused go-to market strategies that leverage our full product offering to service the specific needs of the customers in those unique vertical end markets.",
        "start_character": 49055,
        "end_character": 49395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, we have the capability to compete in adjacent markets, such as other job site services, facilities management, logistics, and others that are natural extensions of our commercial space capabilities.",
        "start_character": 45757,
        "end_character": 45964
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Headquartered in Scottsdale, Arizona, we are a leading business services provider specializing in innovative and flexible turnkey temporary space solutions.",
        "start_character": 175,
        "end_character": 331
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2023, we acquired a US national provider of cold storage solutions, a regional modular space manufacturing and leasing business, and a US national provider of premium large clearspan structures.",
        "start_character": 35653,
        "end_character": 35850
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2024, we achieved new product introductions through innovative development, including our proprietary solar racking systems, and through the acquisition of a US regional provider of perimeter solutions.",
        "start_character": 51950,
        "end_character": 52155
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with our leasing and sales activities, we also provide delivery and installation services, maintenance, removal, and other ad hoc services.",
        "start_character": 3856,
        "end_character": 4009
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the normal course of managing our business, we also sell idle, used rental units at fair market value and units that are already on rent if the customer expresses interest in owning, rather than continuing to rent, the unit.",
        "start_character": 21153,
        "end_character": 21380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
        "accession_number": "0001647088-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our customers operate in a diversified set of end markets, and we track several leading market indicators, such as gross domestic product (\"GDP\"), the Architecture Billing Index (\"ABI\"), non-residential construction square foot starts and put in place construction spending, to predict demand, including demand in our two largest end markets, the commercial and industrial market and the construction and infrastructure market, which accounted for approximately 43% and 42% of our revenues, respectively, for the year ended December 31, 2025.",
        "start_character": 21870,
        "end_character": 22412
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647088-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647088-26-000011-ee0e7e4eb5ec6c82",
